{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed:u000016", "youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed:u000017", "youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed:u000018"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Ask for things you may not get, make requests people may refuse.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed:u000018"}], "text": "Be open to asking for things you may not get and making requests people may refuse."}], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Ask for things you may not get, make requests people may refuse.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed:u000018"}], "text": "Ask for things you may not get and make requests people may refuse."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Over the next seven days, collect twenty rejections.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed:u000017"}], "text": "Collect twenty rejections over the next seven days."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "After twenty rejections, no starts to feel less personal. It stops being a threat and becomes an information.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed:u000018"}], "text": "Recognize that after twenty rejections, 'no' starts to feel less personal and becomes an information rather than a threat."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Over the next seven days, collect twenty rejections.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed:u000017"}], "text": "The assignment is to collect twenty rejections over the next seven days to overcome the fear of hearing 'no'."}, "title": "Overcoming Fear of Rejection", "topic": "rejection"}, "content_hash": "6ee5379ffdd75b81d227e5f584ac2fc8949b34114daf46cfe558954088ffe286", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed:knowledge:21eda6210ca9c880", "metadata_hash": "6922c4d6a46e952bc7443c9c00e7d5ed93b21129415ef25d06973d4f7968ee83", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "57900990414e92a459ab74e2af8b2ff3fe65929ab6ab76b26cbcd1b4fb978c27", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-24-the-real-secret-to-success-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-and-4c881de4ed", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ctpRUnC9eg8", "title": "Overcoming Fear of Rejection", "topic": "rejection", "topic_slug": "rejection"}
